<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Mr. Leonard returns seven weeks after intake. His home readings fell below 140/90 mmHg three weeks ago, and Dr. Okafor-Rosenthal cleared him by phone for full cards, as the cardiologist had advised. He has refereed four full cards since, drinking water between bouts, without breathlessness or chest tightness. His home readings over the past two weeks averaged 134/84 mmHg. He takes losartan-hydrochlorothiazide each morning and atorvastatin each evening without muscle aches, cough or lightheadedness. He walks briskly most mornings and eats less salted meat. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Home blood pressure</td><td>Average 134/84 mmHg over two weeks</td></tr><tr><td>Work</td><td>Four full cards without symptoms</td></tr><tr><td>Kidney function</td><td>Creatinine 1.06 mg/dL, potassium 3.9 mmol/L</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

